"critique": "The artifact fails fundamentally on Brief & Intent Alignment because the primary canvas is an empty void; the requested top-down arena, player, enemies, walls, and AI visualization elements (cones, paths, ranges) are completely missing, rendering the 'demonstration' non-functional. Clarity & Information Hierarchy is compromised by this emptiness; while the right-hand inspector panel is well-structured, it lacks context without the visual data it is supposed to inspect. Visual System & Craft shows a strong, cohesive HUD aesthetic with good typography and spacing in the UI chrome, but the lack of content in the main viewport makes the 'craft' feel like an empty shell. Expressiveness & Distinctiveness is limited to the UI styling; without the actual tactical action, the 'TACTIC//LAB' identity is not substantively expressed through the gameplay elements.",
